Manage the shared credential gateway: one workload of the mcp-gateway image, run in
credential mode, that collects each person's upstream headers at sign-in and
injects them on later requests. It is separate from the per-server gateway
sidecars the operator manages.

Usage:
  mcp-runtime gateway [command]

Available Commands:
  apply       Install the credential gateway for the servers that declare auth.credentialGateway
  status      Show the credential gateway workload and the services it serves

Flags:
  -h, --help   help for gateway

Global Flags:
      --debug   Enable debug mode with structured error logging

Use "mcp-runtime gateway [command] --help" for more information about a command.
